:p006","text":"倫無學，不知書；秀亦以狡黠小才，貪淫昧利。所共立事者，皆邪佞之徒，惟競榮利，無深謀遠略。荂淺薄鄙陋，馥、虔暗很強戾，詡愚嚚輕訬，而各乖異，互相憎毀。秀子會，年二十，為射聲校尉，尚帝女河東公主。公主母喪未期，便納聘禮。會形貌短陋，奴僕之下者，初與富室兒於城西販馬，百姓忽聞其尚主，莫不駭愕。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":69,"last_line":69,"raw_start":6447,"raw_end":6593,"raw_character_offsets":[6449,6450,6451,6452,6453,6454,6455,6456,6457,6458,6459,6460,6461,6462,6463,6464,6465,6466,6467,6468,6469,6470,6471,6472,6473,6474,6475,6476,6477,6478,6479,6480,6481,6482,6483,6484,6485,6486,6487,6488,6489,6490,6491,6492,6493,6494,6495,6496,6497,6498,6499,6500,6501,6502,6503,6504,6505,6506,6507,6508,6509,6510,6511,6512,6513,6514,6515,6516,6517,6518,6519,6520,6521,6522,6523,6524,6525,6526,6527,6528,6529,6530,6531,6532,6533,6534,6535,6536,6537,6538,6539,6540,6541,6542,6543,6544,6545,6546,6547,6548,6549,6550,6551,6552,6553,6554,6555,6556,6557,6558,6559,6560,6561,6562,6563,6564,6565,6566,6567,6568,6569,6570,6571,6572,6573,6574,6575,6576,6577,6578,6579,6580,6581,6582,6583,6584,6585,6586,6587,6588,6589,6590,6591,6592],"revision_id":2650517},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0000","surface":"倫","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0008","surface":"秀","start":8,"end":9,"person_id":"8x5_e5i_yle","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0044","surface":"荂","start":44,"end":45,"person_id":"5js_p45_eky","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0050","surface":"馥","start":50,"end":51,"person_id":"8ng_ftc_im3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0052","surface":"虔","start":52,"end":53,"person_id":"qws_q8f_hgf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0058","surface":"詡","start":58,"end":59,"person_id":"i1g_saj_4ce","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0074","surface":"秀","start":74,"end":75,"person_id":"8x5_e5i_yle","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0076","surface":"會","start":76,"end":77,"person_id":"lka_ccx_iw0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0091","surface":"河東公主","start":91,"end":95,"person_id":"olp_z0w_owb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p006:m0108","surface":"會","start":108,"end":109,"person_id":"lka_ccx_iw0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-lun-ws2650517"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p008","text":"倫從兵五千人，入自端門，登太極殿，滿奮、崔隨、樂廣進璽綬於倫，乃僭即帝位，大赦，改元建始。是歲，賢良方正、直言、秀才、孝廉、良將皆不試；計吏及四方使命之在京邑者，太學生年十六以上及在學二十年，皆署吏；郡縣二千石令長赦日在職者，皆封侯；郡綱紀並為孝廉，縣綱紀為廉史。以世子荂為太子，馥為侍中、大司農、領護軍、京兆王，虔為侍中、大將軍領軍、廣平王，詡為侍中、撫軍將軍、霸城王，孫秀為侍中、中書監、驃騎將軍、儀同三司，張林等諸黨皆登卿將，並列大封。其餘同謀者咸超階越次，不可勝紀，至於奴卒斯役亦加以爵位。每朝會，貂蟬盈坐，時人為之諺曰：「貂不足，狗尾續。」而以苟且之惠取悅人情，府庫之儲不充于賜，金銀冶鑄不給于印，故有白版之侯，君子恥服其章，百姓亦知其不終矣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":73,"last_line":73,"raw_start":6940,"raw_end":7275,"raw_character_offsets":[6942,6943,6944,6945,6946,6947,6948,6949,6950,6951,6952,6953,6954,6955,6956,6957,6958,6959,6960,6961,6962,6963,6964,6965,6966,6967,6968,6969,6970,6971,6972,6973,6974,6975,6976,6977,6978,6979,6980,6981,6985,6986,6987,6988,6992,6993,6994,6995,6996,6997,6998,6999,7000,7001,7002,7003,7004,7005,7006,7007,7008,7009,7010,7011,7012,7013,7014,7015,7016,7017,7018,7019,7020,7021,7022,7023,7024,7025,7026,7027,7028,7029,7030,7031,7032,7033,7034,7035,7036,7037,7038,7039,7040,7041,7042,7043,7044,7045,7046,7047,7048,7049,7050,7051,7052,7053,7054,7055,7056,7057,7058,7059,7060,7061,7062,7063,7064,7065,7066,7067,7068,7069,7070,7071,7072,7073,7074,7075,7076,7077,7078,7079,7080,7081,7082,7083,7084,70